 audience, sender and content, then choose when to send. How does personalization work? Contact properties fill template variables for each recipient. Preview the content with representative data and publish your template before preparing the broadcast. The broadcast uses its selected template version and language. What happens to unsubscribed or suppressed addresses? Bird checks preferences and suppression state while preparing the recipients. People without an eligible email address are filtered out. An audience is not a way to bypass an opt-out. Start with one. Build across channels. Bring your next customer conversation into the same workspace. Email Send, receive, and track email. SMS Send updates. Keep replies connected. WhatsApp Rich messages and conversations. Apple Messages Help customers in Messages. Voice Connect calls and guide conversations. Verify Confirm access with a code. Lookup Check contact details before sending. Mailbox Give your application an inbox. eSIM Build mobile connectivity into your product. Realtime Keep your applications in sync. Your next idea. Ready to connect. Get Started Contact Sales Your next idea. Ready to connect. Get Started Contact Sales All systems operational Products Email SMS WhatsApp Apple Messages Voice Verify Lookup Mailbox eSIM Realtime Build Documentation API reference MCP server CLI AI tools Integrations Developer tools Resources Customer stories Enterprise Guides Explained Learn Changelog Help Company About Bird Blog Careers Newsroom Brand Contact Sales Pricing Connect X LinkedIn Instagram Trust Center Contact support Privacy Terms © 2026 Bird Privacy settings English (US) @@@@.
